  <section xml:id="grading">
    <title>Course Requirements and Grading</title>
    <!--Edit this example as necessary for your course.-->
    <p>
      Final grades will be determined using the following assignment categories (descriptions below):
    </p>
    <tabular>
      <row header="yes">
        <cell>Assignment Category</cell> <cell>Weight</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>Homework (mostly MyOpenMath)</cell> <cell>30%</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>Three Midterm Exams</cell> <cell>15% each</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>Cumulative Final Exam</cell> <cell>25%</cell>
      </row>
    </tabular>
    <p>
      Grading Scale
    </p>
    <tabular>
      <row header="yes">
        <cell>Letter Grade</cell><cell>Point Range (<m>P</m>)</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>A </cell><cell><m>P &gt;93</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>A-</cell><cell><m>90\leq P &lt; 93</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>B+</cell><cell><m>87\leq P &lt; 90</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>B</cell><cell><m>83\leq P &lt; 87</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>B-</cell><cell><m>80\leq P &lt; 83</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>C+</cell><cell><m>77\leq P &lt; 80</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>C</cell><cell><m>83\leq P &lt; 87</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>C-</cell><cell><m>70\leq P &lt; 73</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>D+</cell><cell><m>67\leq P &lt; 70</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>D</cell><cell><m>63\leq P &lt; 67</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>D-</cell><cell><m>60\leq P &lt; 63</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>F</cell><cell><m> P &lt; 60</m></cell>
      </row>
    </tabular>

  
  <paragraphs xml:id="webwork">
    <title>Homework</title>
    <p>
     Most homework will be completed on Canvas using MyOpenMath. Homework will be due according to the following schedule:
    </p>
    <tabular>
      <row header="yes">
        <cell>Day Covered in Class</cell><cell>Day Due</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>Monday</cell><cell>Wednesday</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>Wednesday</cell><cell>Friday</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
      <cell>Thursday</cell><cell>Monday</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell>Friday</cell><cell>Tuesday</cell>
      </row>
    </tabular>
    <p>
      The problems completed with MyOpenMath mostly require the use of R. <term> You will be required to keep a running R document for your homework each week, to be collected on Canvas each Wednesday for review by your professor. </term> There will also be occasional homework that will be submitted "on paper" for grading by your professor.
    </p>
  </paragraphs>

  <paragraphs xml:id="midterm-exams">
    <title>Midterm Exams</title>
    <p>
      There will be three midterm exams given in class on 2/4, 3/4, and 4/8. The class day before exams will be reserved for review. 
    </p>
  </paragraphs>
  <paragraphs xml:id="final">
    <title>Cumulative Final Exam</title>
    <p>
      Your cumulative final exam will be Tuesday, April 28, from 9:45-11:45am.
    </p>
  </paragraphs>
</section>